            "namesLabel": "THE THINKING BEHIND THE BOOK",
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "text": "Sophia Life writes from the field. For more than a decade she has studied the patterns in this book up close and practiced the principles that change them."
              },
              {
                "text": "She paired that practice with years of study across depth psychology, attachment theory, developmental psychology, neuroscience, systems thinking, leadership theory and relational philosophy. The result is a synthesis written for the person living inside these patterns, and for the person who loves them."
              },
              {
                "text": "Sophia is a coach and organizational consultant with a background in urban planning and product development. She writes The Quality of Life on Substack and lives in Boulder, Colorado. [Years in practice, notable clients and speaking credits.]"
